<title>USA: CMSI sees 1996 revs climbing 35 pct.</title>
<headline>CMSI sees 1996 revs climbing 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Management Solutions Inc said Thursday  that preliminary results for 1996 show revenue should jump more than 35 percent to the range of $14 million.</p>
</text>
